    "text": "\"The ancient Hawaiians were astronomers,\" wrote Queen Liliuokalani, Hawaii's last reigning monarch, in 1897.",
    "translation": "“古代夏威夷人都是天文学家”，夏威夷最后一位执政君主利留卡拉尼女王于1897年写道。",
