      "mainClause": "Protests have erupted over construction of the Thirty Meter Telescope (TMT)...",
      "modifiers": "over construction... 作原因状语；a giant observatory 为 TMT 的同位语；that promises to revolutionize humanity's view of the cosmos 为定语从句修饰 observatory。",
      "corePattern": "protests erupt over sth.（围绕……爆发抗议）；promise to do sth.（有望做某事）。"
