      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "At issue is the TMT's planned location on Mauna Kea, a dormant volcano worshiped by some Hawaiians as the piko, that connects the Hawaiian Islands to the heavens.",
    "translation": "争论的焦点是TMT规划的选址就在莫纳克亚山上——这是一座休眠火山，被一些夏威夷人尊奉为“脐带”，连接着夏威夷群岛与天空。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "完全倒装句+同位语+过去分词后置定语+定语从句",
      "mainClause": "The TMT's planned location on Mauna Kea is at issue.（完全倒装）",
      "modifiers": "At issue 置于句首引起倒装；a dormant volcano 为 Mauna Kea 的同位语；worshiped by some Hawaiians as the piko 为过去分词短语作后置定语；that connects the Hawaiian Islands to the heavens 为定语从句修饰 piko。",
      "corePattern": "At issue is sth.（争议的焦点在于……）；connect A to B（将A连接到B）。"
    },
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": true,
      "isUnderlined": false,
