    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P5-S3",
      "pIndex": 5
    },
    "text": "Calls to disassemble all telescopes on Mauna Kea or to ban future development there ignore the reality that astronomy and Hawaiian culture both seek to answer big questions about who we are, where we come from and where we are going.",
    "translation": "拆除莫纳克亚山上所有望远镜或者禁止在那里进一步开发的呼吁忽视了这一现实，就是天文学和夏威夷文化都试图回答几个重大的问题：我们是谁，从何而来以及要去往何处。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": {
      "structureType": "并列不定式定语主语+同位语从句+并列疑问从句",
      "mainClause": "Calls... ignore the reality that astronomy and Hawaiian culture both seek to answer big questions...",
      "modifiers": "to disassemble... or to ban... 为并列不定式短语修饰 Calls；that 引导同位语从句修饰 reality；who we are, where we come from and where we are going 为三个并列从句作 about 的宾语。",
